    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d383">

                <pb facs="0494" n="386" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg386"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Foster to Mr. Coombs.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1892-11-09"><hi rendition="#italic">November 9,
                        1892</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 44.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: In connection with the Department’s
                    instruction No. 32, of September 27, 1892, I inclose for your information, and
                    to complete the record of the case, a copy of a letter of the 4th instant, from
                    Messrs. Henry Hastings &amp; Co., of Boston, with its accompaniment, in relation
                    to the wreck of the ship <hi rendition="#italic">North American</hi>, and the
                    high regard in which they hold the acts of the brave and generous Japanese
                    rescuers.</p>
                <p>I have explained to Messrs. Hastings &amp; Co. the nature of your dispatch upon
                    the subject and of the action of the Department in placing to your credit the
                    sum of $350, to be handed to the Japanese Government for the benefit of the
                    villagers, and of the further desire of the President to present to those of the
                    villagers most conspicuous in the noble and perilous rescue, when their names
                    shall have been obtained, a silver medal suitably engraved.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">John W. Foster.</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d383-a1.xml" xpointer="d383-a1"/>
